   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "\u2022 You control what runs with an AI token\n\u2022 A poisoned commit's jobs get no AI token, unless the central job\n   runs that code\n\u2022 Protected runner stops users running arbitrary jobs\n\u2022 STS can also require the central ci_config_ref_uri\n\u2022 No admin needed for the runner",
   "originalText": "\u2022 You control what runs with an AI token\n\u2022 A poisoned commit's jobs get no AI token, unless the central job\n   runs that code\n\u2022 Protected runner stops users running arbitrary jobs\n\u2022 STS can also require the central ci_config_ref_uri\n\u2022 No admin needed for the runner",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
