   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "\u2022 Central Maintainers can change what all users run\n\u2022 Members may see each other's logs and reports (need-to-know)\n\u2022 Trigger variables are user-controlled input\n\u2022 Commit text still reaches the model, so injection remains possible\n\u2022 Scheduled runs don't get the source project's protected-branch\n   protection",
   "originalText": "\u2022 Central Maintainers can change what all users run\n\u2022 Members may see each other's logs and reports (need-to-know)\n\u2022 Trigger variables are user-controlled input\n\u2022 Commit text still reaches the model, so injection remains possible\n\u2022 Scheduled runs don't get the source project's protected-branch\n   protection",
   "textAlign": "left",
